@startuml Order Process Flow

skinparam activityBackgroundColor #WhiteSmoke
skinparam activityBorderColor #Black
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #LightYellow

title E-commerce Order Process

start

:User browses products;

:Add products to **Cart**;
note right
  Products can be from
  multiple sellers
end note

:User proceeds to checkout;

:Create **Order** with delivery address;

:System splits Order into **SubOrders**
(one per seller);
note right
  Example: 3 products from
  2 sellers = 2 SubOrders
end note

fork
  :SubOrder 1\n(Seller A);
  :Select payment method;
  :Process payment;
  :Ship items;
  :Deliver;
fork again
  :SubOrder 2\n(Seller B);
  :Select payment method;
  :Process payment;
  :Ship items;
  :Deliver;
end fork

:All SubOrders delivered;

:User can write **Review**
for each SubOrder;
note right
  Review rates both:
  - Product (1-5 stars)
  - Seller (1-5 stars)
end note

stop

@enduml
